# The media never goes in git. This repo is public and served by GitHub Pages;
# it is also not where video belongs even if it were private.
#
# clips.txt is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the whole library in a few
# hundred bytes of text -- delete every file below and one `./mobility build`
# rebuilds them. That is the artifact worth keeping.

BJJ Mobility Library/
review/
.cache/

candidates.tsv
exercise_urls.csv

*.mp4
*.mkv
*.webm
*.m4a
*.part
*.ytdl

# Belt and braces: an API key must never land here. See lib/api-search.mjs --
# the key is read from $YT_API_KEY or ~/.config/mobility/youtube-api-key, and
# nothing in this tool writes one to disk.
*key*
*.env
